"""
Curated Fragrances Import Pipeline — Inventory/Collection Tracking.

This category covers BOTH niche/artisan AND designer fragrances for collection tracking.
Users track their fragrance wardrobes — bottle counts, fill levels, notes, and ratings.

Imports a curated catalog of 1,100+ fragrances across niche and designer houses:
  - Niche: MFK, Tom Ford Private Blend, Creed, Parfums de Marly, Xerjoff, Amouage,
    Byredo, Le Labo, Diptyque, Penhaligon's, Frederic Malle, Zoologist, etc.
  - Designer: Dior, Chanel, Guerlain, Hermès, Louis Vuitton, Versace, Prada, YSL,
    Giorgio Armani, Jean Paul Gaultier, Valentino, Dolce & Gabbana, Rabanne,
    Hugo Boss, Burberry, Montblanc, Mugler, Lancome, Givenchy, Carolina Herrera, etc.
  - Middle Eastern: Lattafa, Armaf, Swiss Arabian

Pattern follows import_whiskey.py.
Filename kept as import_niche_perfumery.py for git history clarity.

Usage:
    python -m pipelines.import_niche_perfumery [--dry-run] [--jsonl-only] [--cache-images]
"""

